{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36236","headline":"题龙瑞观兼呈徐尊师 · 方干","name":"题龙瑞观兼呈徐尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"或雨或云常不定，地灵云雨自无时。\n世人莫识神方字，仙鸟偏栖药树枝。\n远壑度年如晦暝，阴溪入夏有凌澌。\n此中唯有师知我，未得寻师即梦师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}